      <div class="note" style="margin-top:8px;font-size:12px">⚠️ <code>TTFTVariabilityConfig</code> and <code>CostPredictabilityConfig</code> are aggregated at the <code>PerformanceMonitor</code> level, not via the <code>@agent_eval</code> decorator. Auto-calculated in <code>generate_report()</code> after <code>monitor.record_task()</code> calls.</div>
